Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["gaCheckIndexConsistencyOnInput", "Section",
 Editable->True,
 Deletable->True,
 TaggingRules->{"TemplateGroupName" -> "Examples"},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958952192749878*^9, 3.9589522091503687`*^9}, 
   3.958952252614608*^9},
 CellTags->{"Examples", "TemplateCellGroup"},
 CellID->692797660,ExpressionUUID->"91474bae-dd65-415b-8b0e-e8c71c1a1130"],

Cell["\<\
(into  mvDownUp[down_List, up_List])  . Specifically it check if indices are \
strictly increasingly ordered (no same indices in mvDownUp[] and if maximal \
value don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t exceed either dimension of vector space of \
algebra or dimension of manifold.  Inconsistent index sets should never \
appear in calculations. Index inconsistency will definitely mean that that \
user input or program code contains error. This option modifies $Pre  \
behaviour. The check can be disabled by setting the option to False.  No \
problems so far were encountered, thought large output is rendered more \
slowly. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958952227543302*^9, 3.958952232747684*^9}, 
   3.9590477673614693`*^9},
 CellID->514667925,ExpressionUUID->"2beeeb35-1b86-4639-abe1-f99ae09e4e19"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["gaMemoizeBasisElementProduct", "Section",
 Editable->True,
 Deletable->True,
 TaggingRules->{"TemplateGroupName" -> "Examples"},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958952192749878*^9, 3.9589522091503687`*^9}, {
  3.958952455747534*^9, 3.958952472994933*^9}},
 CellTags->{"Examples", "TemplateCellGroup"},
 CellID->1095035999,ExpressionUUID->"76748d3f-7cca-4b4f-8cd6-09cd58f9c3fd"],

Cell["\<\

True|False  enables/disables memoization of  basis  element product. \
Memoization is implemented for geometric product expansion in the Association \
form and yields significant speed gain (about 30%). From the other side when \
uses it takes more memory and makes development much more difficult.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9590480991262627`*^9, 3.959048110553146*^9}},
 CellID->1149216477,ExpressionUUID->"e3f0a50e-1ebe-4494-9b59-8ddcb7013e50"]
}, Open  ]],

